Debug mode highlights each declarator of a `const` statement spread over two lines on its own line: `const a` on the first, the bare `b` after the indentation on the second.
== args
--debug
input/const-multi-line.ts
== file input/const-multi-line.ts
const a = 1,
  b = 2;
== stdout
«const a» = 1,
  «b» = 2;
== stderr
== exit 0
